        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paxville%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Joseph Pack arrived in America from England in 1770 and became one of the most extensive land holders in the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
