      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paxville%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A local marker honors Joseph Pack's service with the South Carolina Militia during the Revolutionary War.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
